`disable_delayed_work_sync()` not only cancels any pending work but also marks the work as disabled, so subsequent `queue_delayed_work()` calls (e.g., from `br_cfm_frame_rx()`) are silently ignored. This prevents re‑scheduling on an about‑to‑be‑freed peer_mep, closing the race window.

